{"id":"l81hyc6y97zdostcppfrioqa8","title":"Curl开源项目宣布低中危漏洞公开披露新政策","originalTitle":"Dear Open Source Developers: It's OK not to embargo","summary":"Curl宣布将低中危漏洞直接公开处理，不再保密。对比传统保密流程，指出公开处理可降低维护压力，并建议其他项目参考此模式优化漏洞响应机制。作者通过Curl案例探讨开源生态中漏洞披露流程的失衡现状，提出需通过政策创新平衡漏洞发现与修复的供需矛盾。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://opensourcesecurity.io/2026/10-embargo/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-07T23:31:05.716Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T23:37:24.503Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-07T23:37:24.503Z","category":"security-privacy","tags":["技术方案","GitHub"],"score":59,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"9f3aaa70-9f2f-486e-9eb9-752839c3affd","title":"Curl开源项目公开低中危漏洞披露新政策"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"9f3aaa70-9f2f-486e-9eb9-752839c3affd","title":"Curl开源项目公开低中危漏洞披露新政策"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f4lDNQ76Geis","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}